<title>NORWAY: Norway bond expansion gets 6.02 pct high yield.</title>
<headline>Norway bond expansion gets 6.02 pct high yield.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Norwegian central bank.</p>
<p>ISSUER: Finance Ministry</p>
<p>MATURITY: January 15, 2007</p>
<p>COUPON: 6.75 percent</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.02 pct</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT: 6.0 billion crowns</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 4.5 pct at 105.3 rate</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: annual coupon.</p>
<p>NOTES: This is an expansion of government bond S467.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
